.TH ACTION_DOWN 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
action_down \- True while any input bound to the action is held: any of its keys, its pad button, or its axis pushed past 0.5 in the bound direction
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqactions.h\(dq
.BI "bool action_down(const ActionMap *m, const Input *in, int a);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
True while any input bound to the action is held: any of its keys, its pad button, or its axis pushed past 0.5 in the bound direction. The action\-level equivalent of key_down().
.PP
This is a static inline function; it is defined in the header.
.SH RETURN VALUE
true while held.
.SH MODULE
input (src/engine/input/actions.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR action_pressed (3),
.BR action_axis (3),
.BR key_down (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
